== Variations ==
=== Big Spider ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Big Spider
 | id          = 94
 | base hp     = 20
 | environment = {{floor|Cellar}}{{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Caves}}{{floor|Catacombs}}{{floor|Flooded Caves}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Gehenna}}<br>{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{floor|Sheol}}{{floor|Cathedral}}<br>{{room|curse}}
 | behavior    = Erratically moves around the room. If Isaac gets close to it, it chases him, trying to deal contact damage. Spawns two Spiders upon death.
}}

'''Big Spiders''' look like regular Spiders, but with a large black abdomen attached. They behave in the same way as the regular Spiders, having the same movement speed and erratic behavior. However, they have over triple the health of regular Spiders, and upon death, they will split into two regular Spiders. 

Alternatively, if a Big Spider's health is dropped to -20 or less in one instance (i.e., by using a Bomb), it will spawn nothing on death.
{{clear}}

