'''Striders''' are a type of spider that can only spawn in {{s|Downpour}} and special rooms in {{s|Dross}}. They glide on the water towards Isaac in short bursts and can swim across flooded gaps.

Striders replace all Spider spawns in the Downpour and Dross stages.
